history|n. 历史；历史学|We can learn useful lessons from history.|我们可以从历史中学到有用的经验。
within|prep. 在……之内|Please finish the task within an hour.|请在一小时内完成任务。
force|n. 力量；v. 强迫|Do not force others to agree with you.|不要强迫别人同意你。
education|n. 教育|Education gives people more opportunities.|教育给人们更多机会。
actually|adv. 实际上；事实上|The task was actually easier than I expected.|任务实际上比我预想的容易。
probably|adv. 很可能；大概|She will probably arrive before noon.|她很可能在中午前到达。
human|adj. 人类的；n. 人|Clean water is a basic human need.|清洁的水是人类的基本需求。
nation|n. 国家；民族|The nation has a rich cultural history.|这个国家有丰富的文化历史。
death|n. 死亡|The report studies the causes of early death.|这份报告研究早逝的原因。
course|n. 课程；过程|I am taking a course in English writing.|我正在学习一门英语写作课程。
reach|v. 到达；达到|We hope to reach our goal this year.|我们希望今年实现目标。
local|adj. 当地的；本地的|We buy vegetables from local farmers.|我们从当地农民那里买蔬菜。
kill|v. 杀死；使枯死|Very cold weather can kill young plants.|极冷的天气会使幼小植物枯死。
remain|v. 保持；剩下|Please remain calm during the discussion.|讨论时请保持冷静。
control|n. 控制；v. 管理|Good planning helps us control costs.|良好的规划帮助我们控制成本。
perhaps|adv. 也许；可能|Perhaps we can try another method.|也许我们可以试试另一种方法。
former|adj. 以前的；前任的|She still visits her former school.|她仍然会去探望母校。
rate|n. 比率；速度|The success rate has improved this year.|今年的成功率有所提高。
drug|n. 药物|Take the drug only as your doctor advises.|请仅按医生的建议服用这种药物。
leader|n. 领导者；带头人|A good leader listens to the team.|好的领导者会倾听团队的意见。
voice|n. 嗓音；声音|She spoke in a quiet voice.|她轻声说话。
whole|adj. 整个的；n. 整体|We spent the whole afternoon reading.|我们整个下午都在阅读。
finally|adv. 最后；终于|We finally found a solution.|我们终于找到了解决办法。
military|adj. 军事的；军队的|The museum displays old military uniforms.|博物馆展示旧式军装。
less|adj. 较少的；adv. 更少地|Try to use less water when washing.|洗东西时尽量少用水。
decision|n. 决定；决策|Think carefully before making a decision.|作出决定之前要仔细考虑。
view|n. 看法；景色|The room has a beautiful view of the sea.|这个房间可以看到美丽的海景。
relationship|n. 关系；联系|Trust is important in any relationship.|信任在任何关系中都很重要。
difference|n. 差异；区别|Can you explain the difference between them?|你能解释它们之间的区别吗？
value|n. 价值；v. 珍视|We should value the time we spend together.|我们应该珍惜相处的时光。
international|adj. 国际的|The city hosts an international film festival.|这座城市举办国际电影节。
action|n. 行动；行为|We need to take action to reduce waste.|我们需要采取行动减少浪费。
model|n. 模型；典范|This model shows how the system works.|这个模型展示系统的运作方式。
director|n. 主管；导演|The director explained the project goals.|主管解释了项目目标。
position|n. 位置；职位|She applied for a teaching position.|她申请了一个教学职位。
player|n. 运动员；参加者|Every player has a role in the team.|每个队员在团队中都有自己的作用。
especially|adv. 尤其；特别|I enjoy reading, especially history books.|我喜欢阅读，尤其喜欢历史书。
record|n. 记录；v. 记录|Keep a record of your daily progress.|记录你每天的进步。
special|adj. 特别的；特殊的|This book has a special meaning for me.|这本书对我有特别的意义。
space|n. 空间；太空|We need more space for the new equipment.|我们需要更多空间放新设备。
event|n. 事件；活动|The event brings the community together.|这项活动把社区的人们聚集在一起。
official|adj. 官方的；n. 官员|Check the official website for details.|请到官方网站查看详情。
couple|n. 一对；夫妻|The couple moved to a quiet village.|这对夫妻搬到了一个安静的村庄。
site|n. 场地；地点；网站|The workers arrived at the building site.|工人们到达了建筑工地。
project|n. 项目；工程|Our project aims to improve air quality.|我们的项目旨在改善空气质量。
base|n. 基础；基地|The team needs a strong knowledge base.|团队需要扎实的知识基础。
activity|n. 活动|Outdoor activity is good for our health.|户外活动有益健康。
court|n. 法院；球场|The students played on the basketball court.|学生们在篮球场上打球。
situation|n. 情况；局面|We need to understand the situation first.|我们需要先了解情况。
figure|n. 数字；人物；图形|The report includes figures on employment.|报告包含就业数据。
image|n. 图像；形象|The image clearly shows the damaged area.|图像清楚地显示了受损区域。
phone|n. 电话；v. 打电话|Please turn off your phone during class.|上课时请关闭手机。
recent|adj. 最近的；新近的|Recent studies support this idea.|最近的研究支持这一观点。
product|n. 产品；产物|Read the instructions before using the product.|使用产品前请阅读说明。
test|n. 测试；v. 检验|The test measures basic language skills.|这项测试衡量基本语言技能。
movie|n. 电影|The movie is based on a true story.|这部电影根据真实故事改编。
personal|adj. 个人的；私人的|Do not share your personal information online.|不要在网上分享个人信息。
step|n. 步骤；脚步|Learning a language takes many small steps.|学习语言需要许多小步骤。
type|n. 类型；v. 打字|What type of music do you enjoy?|你喜欢哪种类型的音乐？
attention|n. 注意；关注|Please pay attention to the instructions.|请注意这些说明。
organization|n. 组织；机构|The organization supports children's education.|这个组织支持儿童教育。
choose|v. 选择|You can choose a course that interests you.|你可以选择自己感兴趣的课程。
century|n. 世纪|The building is over a century old.|这座建筑已有一个多世纪的历史。
chance|n. 机会；可能性|Everyone deserves a chance to learn.|每个人都应有学习的机会。
realize|v. 意识到；实现|I realized that practice was necessary.|我意识到练习是必要的。
period|n. 时期；一段时间|The project lasted for a period of six months.|这个项目持续了六个月。
term|n. 术语；学期；期限|The new term begins in September.|新学期九月开始。
choice|n. 选择|Taking the train was a good choice.|坐火车是一个不错的选择。
rule|n. 规则；v. 统治|Everyone must follow the safety rules.|每个人都必须遵守安全规则。
administration|n. 管理；行政部门|The school administration welcomed the proposal.|学校行政部门欢迎这项提议。
material|n. 材料；资料|We use recycled material in our products.|我们的产品使用再生材料。
medical|adj. 医疗的；医学的|The village needs better medical services.|这个村庄需要更好的医疗服务。
church|n. 教堂|The old church stands beside the river.|古老的教堂坐落在河边。
current|adj. 当前的；n. 水流；电流|What is your current address?|你目前的地址是什么？
board|n. 木板；董事会；板|The teacher wrote the answer on the board.|老师把答案写在黑板上。
seek|v. 寻找；寻求|Students can seek advice from their teachers.|学生可以向老师寻求建议。
officer|n. 官员；警官|A police officer helped us find the station.|一位警官帮我们找到了车站。
private|adj. 私人的；私立的|Please keep this information private.|请对这条信息保密。
deal|n. 协议；v. 处理|The two companies agreed on a deal.|两家公司达成了一项协议。
performance|n. 表现；表演|Practice can improve your performance.|练习可以改善你的表现。
fight|v. 战斗；努力抗争|Scientists work together to fight disease.|科学家们合作抗击疾病。
author|n. 作者|The author answered questions about her book.|作者回答了有关她的书的问题。
represent|v. 代表；表示|These numbers represent the total cost.|这些数字表示总费用。
drop|v. 下降；掉落；n. 滴|Temperatures may drop during the night.|夜间气温可能下降。
blood|n. 血液|The nurse took a small sample of blood.|护士抽取了少量血液样本。
agency|n. 机构；代理处|The agency helps people find jobs.|这家机构帮助人们找工作。
nature|n. 自然；本性|Spending time in nature helps me relax.|亲近自然帮助我放松。
color|n. 颜色|The leaves change color in autumn.|树叶在秋天变色。
recently|adv. 最近；近来|She recently started a new job.|她最近开始了一份新工作。
movement|n. 移动；运动|Regular movement keeps the body healthy.|经常活动有助于身体健康。
enter|v. 进入；参加|Please knock before you enter the room.|进入房间前请先敲门。
common|adj. 常见的；共同的|We share a common goal.|我们有一个共同的目标。
race|n. 比赛；竞赛|She finished first in the race.|她在比赛中获得第一名。
series|n. 一系列；系列节目|The course includes a series of short lessons.|这门课程包括一系列短课。
response|n. 回答；反应|Thank you for your quick response.|谢谢你迅速回复。
rise|v. 上升；n. 增加|The sun will rise at six tomorrow.|明天太阳六点升起。
decade|n. 十年|The town has changed over the past decade.|这个城镇在过去十年中发生了变化。
article|n. 文章；物品|I read an interesting article about sleep.|我读了一篇关于睡眠的有趣文章。
shoot|v. 拍摄；射击|They plan to shoot a short film here.|他们计划在这里拍摄一部短片。
save|v. 保存；节省；拯救|Small changes can save energy.|小小的改变可以节约能源。
artist|n. 艺术家|The artist finds inspiration in nature.|这位艺术家从自然中寻找灵感。
scene|n. 场景；现场|The final scene of the film was moving.|电影的最后一幕令人感动。
stock|n. 库存；股票|The store has enough stock for the holiday.|商店有足够的节日库存。
central|adj. 中心的；主要的|Trust is central to a good relationship.|信任是良好关系的核心。
thus|adv. 因此；从而|The road was closed, thus delaying our trip.|道路封闭，因此耽误了我们的行程。
treatment|n. 治疗；对待|The patient received treatment at the hospital.|病人在医院接受了治疗。
exactly|adv. 确切地；恰好|Please tell me exactly what happened.|请准确地告诉我发生了什么。
media|n. 媒体；传播媒介|The media reported on the new policy.|媒体报道了这项新政策。
sign|n. 标志；迹象；v. 签名|A sign showed us the way to the station.|一个指示牌为我们指明了去车站的路。
list|n. 清单；v. 列出|Make a list before you go shopping.|购物前列一张清单。
prepare|v. 准备|We need time to prepare for the exam.|我们需要时间准备考试。
success|n. 成功|Success often comes from patient practice.|成功往往来自耐心的练习。
particularly|adv. 尤其；特别|This book is particularly useful for beginners.|这本书对初学者特别有用。
staff|n. 全体员工|The staff were helpful and friendly.|工作人员热情友好。
character|n. 性格；角色；文字|The main character learns to trust others.|主人公学会了信任别人。
growth|n. 增长；成长|The report shows steady economic growth.|报告显示经济稳定增长。
loss|n. 损失；丧失|Better storage can reduce food loss.|更好的储存方式可以减少食物损耗。
wonder|v. 想知道；n. 奇迹|I wonder why the meeting was canceled.|我想知道会议为什么取消了。
attack|n. 攻击；v. 攻击|The software protects computers from online attacks.|这款软件保护电脑免受网络攻击。
region|n. 地区；区域|The region is famous for its tea.|这个地区以茶叶闻名。
pretty|adj. 漂亮的；adv. 相当|The village has a pretty little garden.|村里有一座美丽的小花园。
trade|n. 贸易；v. 交易|Trade connects countries around the world.|贸易把世界各国联系起来。
election|n. 选举|The election will take place next month.|选举将在下个月举行。
physical|adj. 身体的；物理的|Walking has many physical benefits.|步行对身体有很多益处。
general|adj. 普遍的；大体的|The introduction gives a general overview.|引言给出了总体概述。
message|n. 消息；信息|Please leave a message after the signal.|请在提示音后留言。
analysis|n. 分析|The report includes a detailed analysis of costs.|报告包含对费用的详细分析。
lawyer|n. 律师|A lawyer explained the contract to us.|一位律师向我们解释了合同。
section|n. 部分；章节|Read the final section of the article.|请阅读文章的最后一部分。
professor|n. 教授|The professor encouraged students to ask questions.|教授鼓励学生提问。
operation|n. 运作；手术；操作|The machine is simple in operation.|这台机器操作简单。
financial|adj. 财务的；金融的|Students can apply for financial support.|学生可以申请经济资助。
crime|n. 犯罪；罪行|The program aims to reduce crime.|这个项目旨在减少犯罪。
stage|n. 阶段；舞台|We are at an early stage of the project.|我们处于项目的早期阶段。
authority|n. 权力；权威；主管部门|The local authority manages the public parks.|地方主管部门管理公共公园。
design|n. 设计；v. 设计|Good design makes a product easier to use.|好的设计让产品更容易使用。
sort|n. 种类；v. 整理|What sort of work would you enjoy?|你会喜欢哪种工作？
clearly|adv. 清楚地；显然|Please explain your ideas clearly.|请清楚地解释你的想法。
indeed|adv. 的确；确实|The journey was difficult indeed.|这次旅程确实很艰难。
truth|n. 真相；事实|We need to find out the truth.|我们需要查明真相。
various|adj. 各种各样的|The library offers various learning resources.|图书馆提供各种学习资源。
rather|adv. 相当；宁可|The room is rather small but comfortable.|房间相当小，但很舒适。
executive|n. 管理人员；adj. 执行的|The executive discussed plans with the staff.|这位管理人员与员工讨论了计划。
prove|v. 证明|The results prove that the method works.|结果证明这种方法有效。
hang|v. 悬挂|You can hang your coat by the door.|你可以把外套挂在门边。
rock|n. 岩石；摇滚乐|The path goes around a large rock.|小路绕过一块大岩石。
remove|v. 移除；去除|Please remove your shoes before entering.|进入之前请脱鞋。
network|n. 网络；关系网|The school has a reliable computer network.|学校有可靠的计算机网络。
legal|adj. 法律的；合法的|The company asked for legal advice.|这家公司寻求了法律意见。
religious|adj. 宗教的|We should respect different religious beliefs.|我们应该尊重不同的宗教信仰。
cold|adj. 寒冷的；n. 感冒|Remember to wear a coat in cold weather.|天气寒冷时记得穿外套。
final|adj. 最后的；n. 决赛|The final decision will be made tomorrow.|最终决定将在明天作出。
main|adj. 主要的|What is the main purpose of the report?|这份报告的主要目的是什么？
memory|n. 记忆；记忆力|Sleep plays a role in memory.|睡眠对记忆起着作用。
cell|n. 细胞；小房间|Each cell in the body has a function.|身体里的每个细胞都有其功能。
trial|n. 试验；审判|The new system is on trial this month.|新系统本月进行试用。
firm|n. 公司；adj. 坚定的|She works for a small law firm.|她在一家小型律师事务所工作。
management|n. 管理；管理层|Good time management reduces stress.|良好的时间管理能减轻压力。
imagine|v. 想象|Imagine a city with no traffic noise.|想象一座没有交通噪声的城市。
huge|adj. 巨大的|The project was a huge success.|这个项目取得了巨大成功。
statement|n. 声明；陈述|The company issued a short statement.|公司发表了一份简短声明。
charge|n. 费用；v. 收费|There is no charge for using the library.|使用图书馆不收费。
popular|adj. 受欢迎的；流行的|Cycling is popular among young people.|骑自行车在年轻人中很受欢迎。
direction|n. 方向；指示|We walked in the direction of the river.|我们朝河流的方向走去。
employee|n. 雇员；员工|Every employee received safety training.|每位员工都接受了安全培训。
peace|n. 和平；安宁|We enjoyed the peace of the countryside.|我们享受乡村的宁静。
pain|n. 疼痛；痛苦|Tell the doctor if you feel any pain.|如果感到疼痛，请告诉医生。
shake|v. 摇动；握手|The two visitors shook hands.|两位来访者握了手。
interview|n. 面试；采访|She prepared carefully for the interview.|她认真准备了面试。
manage|v. 管理；设法做到|He manages a small team.|他管理一个小团队。
camera|n. 照相机；摄像机|This camera works well in low light.|这台相机在弱光下表现良好。
politics|n. 政治；政治活动|The course explores the relationship between politics and economics.|这门课程探讨政治与经济的关系。
suddenly|adv. 突然|The lights suddenly went out.|灯突然熄灭了。
candidate|n. 候选人；应聘者|Each candidate will answer the same questions.|每位应聘者都将回答相同的问题。
production|n. 生产；制作|The factory increased production last year.|这家工厂去年提高了产量。
treat|v. 对待；治疗|We should treat others with respect.|我们应该尊重他人。
inside|prep. 在……里面；adv. 在内部|Please wait inside the building.|请在楼内等候。
conference|n. 会议；研讨会|The conference brings researchers together.|这次会议让研究人员聚集交流。
unit|n. 单位；单元|The course has six units.|这门课程有六个单元。
style|n. 风格；方式|Everyone has a different learning style.|每个人都有不同的学习方式。
adult|n. 成年人；adj. 成年的|Every adult can learn new skills.|每个成年人都可以学习新技能。
edge|n. 边缘|Do not stand too close to the edge.|不要站得离边缘太近。
writer|n. 作家；作者|The writer draws on personal experience.|这位作家从个人经历中取材。
throughout|prep. 遍及；贯穿|The museum is open throughout the year.|博物馆全年开放。
fear|n. 恐惧；v. 害怕|Practice helped her overcome her fear.|练习帮助她克服了恐惧。
shoulder|n. 肩膀|He carried a bag over his shoulder.|他肩上挎着一个包。
institution|n. 机构；制度|The institution supports scientific research.|这家机构支持科学研究。
dream|n. 梦想；梦|Her dream is to travel around the world.|她的梦想是环游世界。
property|n. 财产；特性|Please respect other people's property.|请尊重他人的财产。
stuff|n. 东西；物品|We packed our stuff into two bags.|我们把东西装进了两个包。
magazine|n. 杂志|I read a science magazine every month.|我每个月读一本科学杂志。
heat|n. 热；v. 加热|The heat made it difficult to work outside.|炎热的天气使户外工作变得困难。
marriage|n. 婚姻|Trust is important in a marriage.|信任在婚姻中很重要。
tough|adj. 艰难的；坚韧的|It was a tough decision to make.|这是一个艰难的决定。
pattern|n. 模式；图案|The study found a clear pattern.|研究发现了一个清晰的规律。
skin|n. 皮肤|Protect your skin from strong sunlight.|保护皮肤免受强烈阳光照射。
agent|n. 代理人；经纪人|A travel agent helped us plan the trip.|一位旅行代理人帮助我们计划旅程。
owner|n. 所有者；主人|The owner welcomed us into the shop.|店主欢迎我们进店。
commercial|adj. 商业的；n. 广告|The building is used for commercial purposes.|这座建筑用于商业用途。
address|n. 地址；v. 致辞；处理|Please write your address clearly.|请清楚地写下你的地址。
cancer|n. 癌症|Researchers are studying new ways to treat cancer.|研究人员正在探索治疗癌症的新方法。
item|n. 项目；一件物品|Check each item on the list.|检查清单上的每一项。
reality|n. 现实；实际情况|The plan must reflect reality.|计划必须符合实际情况。
