yard|n. 院子；码|The children played in the yard.|孩子们在院子里玩耍。
violence|n. 暴力|The program teaches ways to prevent violence.|这个项目教授预防暴力的方法。
total|adj. 总计的；n. 总数|The total cost includes transport.|总费用包括交通费。
