safe|adj. 安全的|Keep important documents in a safe place.|把重要文件放在安全的地方。
capital|n. 首都；资本|The capital has an excellent transport system.|首都有完善的交通系统。
victim|n. 受害者|Volunteers offered support to flood victims.|志愿者为洪灾受害者提供支持。
responsibility|n. 责任；职责|Taking care of the environment is everyone's responsibility.|保护环境是每个人的责任。
score|n. 得分；v. 得分|Her test score improved after regular practice.|经过定期练习，她的测试成绩提高了。
audience|n. 观众；听众|The audience listened carefully to the speaker.|听众认真聆听演讲者讲话。
vote|n. 投票；v. 投票|Each member has one vote.|每位成员有一票。
citizen|n. 公民；市民|Citizens can help improve their community.|市民可以帮助改善社区。
majority|n. 大多数；多数|The majority of students supported the plan.|大多数学生支持这项计划。
senior|adj. 年长的；高级的|A senior colleague offered useful advice.|一位资深同事提出了有用的建议。
professional|adj. 专业的；n. 专业人员|Seek professional advice before signing the contract.|签合同之前请寻求专业意见。
mission|n. 使命；任务|The organization's mission is to support education.|这个组织的使命是支持教育。
alone|adj. 独自的；adv. 独自|She enjoys reading alone in the library.|她喜欢独自在图书馆阅读。
customer|n. 顾客；客户|The shop listens to customer feedback.|商店倾听顾客的反馈。
speech|n. 演讲；言语|She gave a short speech about teamwork.|她发表了关于团队合作的简短演讲。
successful|adj. 成功的|The project was successful because everyone helped.|项目取得成功，因为每个人都提供了帮助。
option|n. 选择；选项|We should consider every option.|我们应该考虑每一种选择。
southern|adj. 南部的|The southern part of the country is warm.|这个国家的南部很温暖。
eventually|adv. 最终；终于|With practice, the task eventually became easier.|经过练习，这项任务最终变得容易了。
university|n. 大学|She studies engineering at university.|她在大学学习工程学。
fresh|adj. 新鲜的；清新的|Open the window to let in fresh air.|打开窗户，让新鲜空气进来。
forest|n. 森林|The forest is home to many species.|森林是许多物种的家园。
video|n. 视频；录像|The video explains how the machine works.|这个视频解释机器如何运转。
reform|n. 改革；v. 改革|The reform aims to improve public services.|这项改革旨在改善公共服务。
